  "body": "Property Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/A1H7\r\n\r\nLove the benefits of a brand-new home without compromising on space, garden, or sea views? Welcome to 23A Carlisle Road, Browns Bay( the first of three to be launched) - a substantial freehold residence designed for easy modern family living.\r\n\r\nBeautifully appointed, this home combines generous proportions, contemporary style and a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the designer kitchen features quality Bosch appliances and a spacious butler's pantry, flowing effortlessly into the dining and family living areas. The sun-filled lounge opens to the deck and captures lovely sea views.\r\n\r\nThe versatile lower-level suite offers its own bathroom, living area and bar - perfect for extended family, guests or teenagers wanting their own space.\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n\r\n*\tFour generous bedrooms, including luxury master with ensuite & walk in wardrobe\r\n*\tThree bathrooms and four toilets\r\n*\tSpacious butler's pantry with additional gas cooking facilities, double sink and rangehood\r\n*\tFour living areas- space for all the family\r\n*\tDucted heating, insulation, and double glazing\r\n*\tUnder floor heating/heated towel rails in the bathrooms\r\n*\tBeautifully landscaped, easy-care grounds\r\n*\tGenerous decking for outdoor living\r\n*\tDouble internal-access garage\r\n*\tFreehold - No Body Corp\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned close to Browns Bay village, beaches, cafés, shops, schools, and transport, this is a wonderful opportunity to enjoy space, style, and brand-new coastal living.\r\n \r\nStunning High-Quality Design and Finish.\r\n\r\nCall us to secure your private viewing!\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
